    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/jmm-grand-suites/hotel/manila-ph.html",
    "name": "JMM Grand Suites",
    "detail": "Was allocated a room in the 31st floor. Wonderful location because hotel is adjacent to Robinson’s Ermita Mall where wonderful restaurants and shops are. The streets within the perimeter of the hotel is dirty and busy with lots of pubs and bars around the area. Security is great as access is only permitted to cardholders or those booked within the hotel. The room is spacious, with everything you need in it to make your stay comfortable. It has a kitchennette, TV cable, fridge and ofher basic amenities such as toothbrush, slippers and soft couch. Bed is comfortable, bathroom is spacious, hot and cold shower is strong and good. One of the few budget hotels in manila and makati that has a microwave to heat your food! Floor is wooden tiles that makes the ambience of the room so cozy. Service by staff is great! Negative feedback is that the room is adjacent to the trash room of the 31st floor which stinks in a hot and hunid weather. Aircon is noisy which kept me awake all night! ",
